1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,008
Bugungi videomiz nima haqida? Yaponiyaning izakaya baridagi suhbat.

2
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:11,508
Sahna 1: Izakaya zaldagi bron qilish va joylash / Izakaya bron qilish va joylash haqida kirish

3
00:00:11,508 --> 00:00:13,341
Xush kelibsiz!

4
00:00:13,364 --> 00:00:15,938
Izakayaga xush kelibsiz.

5
00:00:15,961 --> 00:00:18,860
Salom, ikki kishimiz.

6
00:00:18,884 --> 00:00:20,650
Tushunarli.

7
00:00:20,673 --> 00:00:23,676
Bugun bron qilganmisiz?

8
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,033
Yoʻq, bron qilmaganmiz.

9
00:00:27,056 --> 00:00:29,023
Tushunarli.

10
00:00:29,046 --> 00:00:31,479
Hech qisi yo'q.

11
00:00:31,502 --> 00:00:33,311
Yaxshi boʻldi.

12
00:00:33,334 --> 00:00:35,868
Chekishni xohlaysizmi?

13
00:00:35,891 --> 00:00:38,741
Yoʻq, chekmaymiz.

14
00:00:38,764 --> 00:00:41,702
Chekmaydigan joyga oʻtirishni xohlaymiz.

15
00:00:41,725 --> 00:00:43,892
Tushunarli.

16
00:00:43,915 --> 00:00:47,048
Chekmaydigan joyga sizni olib borayapman.

17
00:00:47,071 --> 00:00:48,688
Rahmat.

18
00:00:48,712 --> 00:00:50,802
Ichkaridagi joymi?

19
00:00:50,825 --> 00:00:54,825
Ha, ichkaridagi stol.

20
00:00:54,848 --> 00:00:56,692
Bu yerga keling.

21
00:00:56,716 --> 00:00:59,516
Bu joy yorugʻ va chiroyli ekan.

22
00:00:59,539 --> 00:01:01,436
Rahmat.

23
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:04,193
Bu joy sizga maqulmi?

24
00:01:04,216 --> 00:01:07,508
Ha, juda yaxshi joy.

25
00:01:07,532 --> 00:01:10,932
Yuklaringizni shu qutiga soling.

26
00:01:10,955 --> 00:01:12,955
Tushunarli.

27
00:01:12,978 --> 00:01:15,911
Aytganingiz uchun raxmat.

28
00:01:15,934 --> 00:01:18,272
Band ekan-ku.

29
00:01:18,296 --> 00:01:22,232
Juma kunlari mehmonlar koʻp boʻladi.

30
00:01:22,256 --> 00:01:24,589
Shundaymi?

31
00:01:24,612 --> 00:01:27,022
Kirishimiz yaxshi boʻldi.

32
00:01:27,046 --> 00:01:29,779
Hamrohingiz tez orada keladimi?

33
00:01:29,802 --> 00:01:33,235
Ha, besh daqiqada keladi.

34
00:01:33,258 --> 00:01:35,025
Tushunarli.

35
00:01:35,048 --> 00:01:37,697
Menyuni olib kelaman.

36
00:01:37,721 --> 00:01:39,411
Iltimos.

37
00:01:39,434 --> 00:01:41,968
Suv ham berishingiz mumkinmi?

38
00:01:41,991 --> 00:01:45,268
Ha, darhol olib kelaman.

39
00:01:45,291 --> 00:01:49,098
Stolda turgan QR kod nima uchun?

40
00:01:49,122 --> 00:01:53,255
Bu QR kod orqali telefoningizdan buyurtma berishingiz mumkin.

41
00:01:53,278 --> 00:01:55,122
Qulay ekan.

42
00:01:55,145 --> 00:01:58,029
Telefon orqali buyurtma beraman.

43
00:01:58,053 --> 00:02:02,086
Qogʻoz menyu ham bor, undan foydalanishingiz mumkin.

44
00:02:02,109 --> 00:02:04,242
Tushunarli.

45
00:02:04,265 --> 00:02:06,032
Rahmat.

46
00:02:06,055 --> 00:02:09,633
Endi sekin tanlang.

47
00:02:09,656 --> 00:02:13,223
Xop, raxmat.

48
00:02:13,246 --> 00:02:22,255
Bugungi videoning skriptini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentdan yuklab olish mumkin. Yuklab olishdan oldin izoh qoldirishni unutmang.

49
00:02:22,255 --> 00:02:23,755
Sahna 2: Mijozlarga xizmat koʻrsatish odobi asoslari / Mijozlarga xizmat koʻrsatish odobi asoslari

50
00:02:23,755 --> 00:02:26,633
Bugun ham charchadingizmi, yaxshi ish qildingiz.

51
00:02:26,656 --> 00:02:29,195
Ishni boshlaymiz.

52
00:02:29,219 --> 00:02:31,752
Iltimos.

53
00:02:31,775 --> 00:02:34,433
Nima qilishim kerak?

54
00:02:34,457 --> 00:02:39,754
Avvalo, mijozlarni joylashtirgandan keyin qilinadigan ishlar.

55
00:02:39,778 --> 00:02:43,258
Ha, yaxshi eslab qolaman.

56
00:02:43,281 --> 00:02:48,155
Mijoz oʻtirgandan soʻng darhol salfetka bering.

57
00:02:48,179 --> 00:02:50,589
Namakobdir.

58
00:02:50,612 --> 00:02:53,020
Issiqmi?

59
00:02:53,043 --> 00:02:57,843
Ha, iltimos, issiq namakob bering.

60
00:02:57,866 --> 00:02:59,833
Tushunarli.

61
00:02:59,856 --> 00:03:02,500
Ikkala qoʻl bilan beraymi?

62
00:03:02,523 --> 00:03:08,123
Ha, „Xush kelibsiz!“ deb, muloyimlik bilan bering.

63
00:03:08,146 --> 00:03:09,780
Ha.

64
00:03:09,803 --> 00:03:12,940
Katta ovoz bilan salom bering.

65
00:03:12,964 --> 00:03:17,497
Keyin, menyuni stol ustiga qoʻying.

66
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:21,120
Menyu har bir kishiga bittadanmi?

67
00:03:21,144 --> 00:03:26,024
Yoʻq, guruhga ikkita qoʻysangiz yetadi.

68
00:03:26,048 --> 00:03:28,514
Tushunarli.

69
00:03:28,537 --> 00:03:31,504
Suvni ham olib kelaymi?

70
00:03:31,528 --> 00:03:36,534
Izakaya ekan, avval sovuq suv yoki choy bering.

71
00:03:36,557 --> 00:03:40,757
Mijozga qaysi biri yaxshi ekanini soʻraymi?

72
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:42,747
Ha, shunday.

73
00:03:42,770 --> 00:03:47,451
Issiq choy yoki sovuq suv kerakligini soʻrang.

74
00:03:47,474 --> 00:03:49,927
Tushunarli.

75
00:03:49,950 --> 00:03:53,364
Eslab qolish uchun yozib olsam boʻladimi?

76
00:03:53,388 --> 00:03:57,121
Boshida yozib oling. Ha.

77
00:03:57,144 --> 00:04:00,477
Daftar va ruchkani tayyorlang.

78
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:04,734
Keyin, bugungi tavsiya taomlari doskasini ham koʻrsatib qoʻying.

79
00:04:04,757 --> 00:04:08,643
Tavsiya doskasi qayerda?

80
00:04:08,666 --> 00:04:12,120
Oshxona yonidagi javon ustida turibdi.

81
00:04:12,143 --> 00:04:14,156
Tushunarli.

82
00:04:14,179 --> 00:04:16,413
Tasdiqlab kelaman.

83
00:04:16,436 --> 00:04:20,678
Buyurtma aniqlangandan soʻng, tugmani bosishlarini soʻrang.

84
00:04:20,701 --> 00:04:24,874
Signal yangraganda darhol borish kerak, shundaymi?

85
00:04:24,897 --> 00:04:27,830
Aynan shunday.

86
00:04:27,853 --> 00:04:30,387
Tabassum bilan xizmat qiling.

87
00:04:30,410 --> 00:04:32,043
Ha.

88
00:04:32,066 --> 00:04:33,999
Harakat qilaman.

89
00:04:34,022 --> 00:04:38,075
Nimadur tushunmagan boʻlsa, har narsani soʻrashingiz mumkin.

90
00:04:38,099 --> 00:04:39,766
Ha.

91
00:04:39,790 --> 00:04:42,556
Iltimos.

92
00:04:42,579 --> 00:04:49,684
Bugungi videodagi mashqlarni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yuqori kommentariyada topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

93
00:04:49,684 --> 00:04:51,184
3-Sahna: Buyurtma olish mashqi / Buyurtma olishni mashq qilish

94
00:04:51,184 --> 00:04:53,584
Xush kelibsiz!

95
00:04:53,607 --> 00:04:57,293
Buyurtmangiz tayyormi?

96
00:04:57,317 --> 00:05:02,590
Ha, avval ichimlik buyurtma qilmoqchiman.

97
00:05:02,614 --> 00:05:04,890
Tushunarli.

98
00:05:04,913 --> 00:05:07,713
Nima buyurasiz?

99
00:05:07,736 --> 00:05:12,936
Avvaliga, 2 ta tirik pivo bering.

100
00:05:12,959 --> 00:05:16,233
2 ta tirik pivo, shundaymi?

101
00:05:16,256 --> 00:05:18,428
Tushunarli.

102
00:05:18,451 --> 00:05:23,418
A, doʻstim haybol (viski-soda) yaxshi ekanligini aytdi.

103
00:05:23,441 --> 00:05:30,316
Demak, 1 ta tirik pivo va 1 ta haybol, shundaymi?

104
00:05:30,339 --> 00:05:33,754
Ha, shunday qilib bering.

105
00:05:33,778 --> 00:05:39,044
Haybolda konsentratsiyani kuchaytirish mumkin, qanday qilay?

106
00:05:39,067 --> 00:05:42,304
Oddiy konsentratsiyada yetarli.

107
00:05:42,328 --> 00:05:44,409
Tushunarli.

108
00:05:44,433 --> 00:05:48,166
Muz solaymi?

109
00:05:48,189 --> 00:05:52,085
Ha, muz soling.

110
00:05:52,109 --> 00:05:58,509
Tirik pivoda katta va kichik oʻlchamlar bor.

111
00:05:58,532 --> 00:06:01,340
Oʻrta oʻlchamda bering.

112
00:06:01,364 --> 00:06:04,097
Oʻrta oʻlchamli tirik pivo, shundaymi?

113
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,411
Tushunarli.

114
00:06:06,434 --> 00:06:09,434
Ichimliklar tez keladimi?

115
00:06:09,457 --> 00:06:14,024
Ha, tezda tayyorlab olib kelamiz.

116
00:06:14,047 --> 00:06:15,742
Rahmat.

117
00:06:15,765 --> 00:06:18,165
Kutishdan zavqlanaman.

118
00:06:18,188 --> 00:06:21,261
Bugungi zakuska nima?

119
00:06:21,284 --> 00:06:25,217
Bugun noʻxat va kichik idishlar.

120
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:27,207
Yaxshi ekan!

121
00:06:27,230 --> 00:06:29,724
Iltimos, boshlov taomlarini ham olib keling.

122
00:06:29,748 --> 00:06:32,003
Tushunarli.

123
00:06:32,026 --> 00:06:35,026
Boshlov taomlari ikkita, shundaymi?

124
00:06:35,049 --> 00:06:38,882
Taomlarni keyinroq buyurtma qilsak bo‘ladimi?

125
00:06:38,905 --> 00:06:43,156
Ha, tanlaganingizdan so‘ng chaqirib yuboring.

126
00:06:43,180 --> 00:06:45,187
Tushunarli.

127
00:06:45,211 --> 00:06:48,277
Sekin-asta menyuni ko‘raman.

128
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:53,034
Shunda, xom pivo va xaybolni olib kelamiz.

129
00:06:53,057 --> 00:06:56,195
Ha, iltimos.

130
00:06:56,218 --> 00:06:58,854
Biroz kutib turing.

131
00:06:58,878 --> 00:07:01,912
Ha, kutamiz.

132
00:07:01,936 --> 00:07:03,436
4-Sahna: Ishdan keyin salomlashish / Ishdan Keyingi Qayfiyat

133
00:07:03,436 --> 00:07:06,120
Ishdan chiqqaningiz uchun rahmat.

134
00:07:06,143 --> 00:07:08,745
Ichimliklar keldi-ku.

135
00:07:08,768 --> 00:07:11,228
Ishdan chiqqaningiz uchun rahmat.

136
00:07:11,251 --> 00:07:14,136
Og‘zim qurib qoldi-ku.

137
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:19,693
Shu hafta ham ishlaganingiz uchun rahmat.

138
00:07:19,716 --> 00:07:22,450
Ishdan chiqqaningiz uchun rahmat.

139
00:07:22,473 --> 00:07:24,839
Qo‘l to‘playmiz!

140
00:07:24,862 --> 00:07:26,829
Qo‘l to‘g‘ramiz!

141
00:07:26,852 --> 00:07:29,019
Qo‘l to‘g‘ramiz!

142
00:07:29,042 --> 00:07:34,775
Gulp-gulp... ah, shu mazali ekan!

143
00:07:34,798 --> 00:07:40,246
Rostdan, pivo sovuq ekan, zo‘r!

144
00:07:40,269 --> 00:07:45,157
Ishdan keyin ichiladigan pivodan mazaliroq narsa yo‘q.

145
00:07:45,181 --> 00:07:50,548
Bu yerda pivo ko‘piklari juda chiroyli ekan.

146
00:07:50,571 --> 00:07:52,706
Rostdan ham shunday.

147
00:07:52,729 --> 00:07:56,104
Sovuq ekan, ichish oson.

148
00:07:56,127 --> 00:07:59,706
Bir yutishda yarmini ichib yubordim.

149
00:07:59,729 --> 00:08:03,496
He-he, tez ichayapsiz-ku.

150
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:07,418
Bugun juda band edik-ku.

151
00:08:07,441 --> 00:08:11,516
Ko‘p qilib, ortiqcha ishladik-ku.

152
00:08:11,539 --> 00:08:15,792
Shuning uchun bu bir stakan juda mazali.

153
00:08:15,815 --> 00:08:19,382
Boshlovdagi no‘xatni ham yeyish kerak.

154
00:08:19,405 --> 00:08:23,249
A, tuzlangan no‘xat juda mazali ekan.

155
00:08:23,272 --> 00:08:26,072
Pivoga juda mos keladi.

156
00:08:26,095 --> 00:08:28,982
Eng zo‘r gazak ekan.

157
00:08:29,005 --> 00:08:32,239
Ko‘p ichmang, iltimos.

158
00:08:32,263 --> 00:08:34,339
Muammo yo‘q.

159
00:08:34,363 --> 00:08:36,899
Bugun zavqlanib ichamiz.

160
00:08:36,922 --> 00:08:41,701
Ha, ko‘p mazali taomlar buyurtma qilamiz.

161
00:08:41,724 --> 00:08:44,005
Yaxshi ekan!

162
00:08:44,029 --> 00:08:47,243
Menyuga qarab chiqamizmi?

163
00:08:47,267 --> 00:08:50,915
Biroz oldin yana bir yutib olaman.

164
00:08:50,938 --> 00:08:53,305
Men ham ichaman.

165
00:08:53,328 --> 00:08:56,102
Hmm, mazali.

166
00:08:56,126 --> 00:08:59,261
Baxtli dam olish ekan.

167
00:08:59,284 --> 00:09:03,096
Izakayaga kelganimiz yaxshi bo‘ldi.

168
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:06,920
Bugun ko‘p gaplashib, zavqlanamiz.

169
00:09:06,943 --> 00:09:11,283
Ha, oxirigacha birga ichamiz.

170
00:09:11,306 --> 00:09:12,806
5-Sahna: Nima buyurtma qilish kerak / Nima Buyurtma Qilishni Bilish

171
00:09:12,806 --> 00:09:17,073
Endi taomlarni buyurtma qilamiz.

172
00:09:17,096 --> 00:09:19,029
Yaxshi ekan!

173
00:09:19,052 --> 00:09:21,670
Nima yeysiz?

174
00:09:21,694 --> 00:09:24,927
Go‘shtli taomlar yeymoqchiman.

175
00:09:24,950 --> 00:09:29,117
Bizda tovuq qovurma va grilda pishirilgan tovuq bor.

176
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:31,774
Ikki oʻrtada qoldim.

177
00:09:31,797 --> 00:09:34,332
Qaysi birini tanlaysiz?

178
00:09:34,356 --> 00:09:38,289
Men tovuq qovurmani yaxshi koʻraman.

179
00:09:38,312 --> 00:09:43,845
Tovuq qovurma yaxshi, lekin yakitori ham juda mazali.

180
00:09:43,868 --> 00:09:49,302
Yakitorini tuzli va sousli qaysi birini yaxshi koʻrasiz?

181
00:09:49,325 --> 00:09:53,858
Men shirin sousni yaxshi koʻraman.

182
00:09:53,881 --> 00:09:57,814
Men esa yengil tuzliroqni afzal koʻraman.

183
00:09:57,837 --> 00:10:02,304
Shunda aralash buyurtma beramizmi?

184
00:10:02,327 --> 00:10:06,694
Aralash buyurtmada ikkisi ham bor.

185
00:10:06,717 --> 00:10:11,328
Tuzli va sousli ikkalasini ham buyurtma qilish mumkin.

186
00:10:11,352 --> 00:10:14,231
Bu yaxshi fikr ekan.

187
00:10:14,255 --> 00:10:18,388
Tovuq qovurmani ham bir porsiya buyurtma qilamizmi?

188
00:10:18,411 --> 00:10:20,445
Yaxshi ekan!

189
00:10:20,468 --> 00:10:23,305
Ikkalasini ham yeyish kerak.

190
00:10:23,328 --> 00:10:25,895
Hammasini yeyishga qodir boʻlasizmi?

191
00:10:25,918 --> 00:10:29,851
Biroz koʻp boʻlishi mumkin.

192
00:10:29,874 --> 00:10:33,508
Oshqozon och, muammo yoʻq.

193
00:10:33,531 --> 00:10:36,864
Salat ham biror narsa buyurtma qilaylik.

194
00:10:36,887 --> 00:10:39,720
Sezar salati qanday?

195
00:10:39,743 --> 00:10:42,230
Juda yaxshi koʻraman.

196
00:10:42,254 --> 00:10:44,550
Shuni tanlaymiz.

197
00:10:44,573 --> 00:10:47,858
Moxora salati ham mazali koʻrinadi.

198
00:10:47,881 --> 00:10:51,948
Bugun Sezar salatini tanlamaymizmi?

199
00:10:51,971 --> 00:10:54,145
Tushunarli.

200
00:10:54,169 --> 00:10:56,602
Shunday qilamiz.

201
00:10:56,625 --> 00:10:59,958
Assorti sashimi ham yaxshi boʻlardi.

202
00:10:59,981 --> 00:11:04,434
Bugungi tavsiya etilgan baliq bor ekan.

203
00:11:04,457 --> 00:11:08,824
Baliq ham, goʻsht ham hammasini buyurtma qilamizmi?

204
00:11:08,847 --> 00:11:13,023
Biroz-birozdan buyurtma qilish yaxshiroq.

205
00:11:13,047 --> 00:11:14,680
Ha, shunday.

206
00:11:14,703 --> 00:11:17,757
Avval goʻsht va salatni buyurtma qilamiz.

207
00:11:17,781 --> 00:11:19,347
Ha.

208
00:11:19,370 --> 00:11:22,137
Ofitsantni chaqiramiz.

209
00:11:22,160 --> 00:11:23,660
6-Sahna: Buyurtma va tavsiyalar / Buyurtmalar va Taomlar Tavsiya Qilish

210
00:11:23,660 --> 00:11:26,111
Chaqirdingizmi?

211
00:11:26,135 --> 00:11:29,404
Buyurtmangizni qabul qilamiz.

212
00:11:29,427 --> 00:11:33,630
Uzr, bugungi tavsiya etilgan taom nima?

213
00:11:33,654 --> 00:11:38,987
Bugungi tavsiya etilgan taom – yangi sashimi assortisi.

214
00:11:39,010 --> 00:11:42,143
Qanday baliqlar bor?

215
00:11:42,166 --> 00:11:46,439
Tuna, losos va amberjack bor.

216
00:11:46,463 --> 00:11:48,732
Mazali koʻrinadi.

217
00:11:48,755 --> 00:11:52,355
Hozir eng mazali baliqmi?

218
00:11:52,378 --> 00:11:56,845
Baliqlar bugun ertalab portdan keltirildi.

219
00:11:56,868 --> 00:11:59,901
Bu juda yaxshi ekan.

220
00:11:59,924 --> 00:12:02,157
Bitta bering.

221
00:12:02,180 --> 00:12:03,780
Rahmat.

222
00:12:03,803 --> 00:12:06,437
Sashimi assortisi, shundaymi?

223
00:12:06,460 --> 00:12:10,026
Boshqa mashhur gazaklar bormi?

224
00:12:10,049 --> 00:12:14,666
Doʻkonda tayyorlanadigan tamago (dashi maki) juda mashhur.

225
00:12:14,690 --> 00:12:17,166
Dashi maki tuxumi deysizmi?

226
00:12:17,190 --> 00:12:19,190
Issiqmi?

227
00:12:19,213 --> 00:12:23,261
Ha, buyurtma berganingizdan keyin pishiramiz.

228
00:12:23,284 --> 00:12:26,485
Yumshoq va mazali koʻrinadi.

229
00:12:26,509 --> 00:12:31,349
Dashi taʼmli va juda mazali ekan.

230
00:12:31,372 --> 00:12:35,612
Unda, bitta oddiy dashimaki tuxum ham olamiz.

231
00:12:35,636 --> 00:12:40,636
Mentayko va pishlo qoʻshilgan dashimaki tuxum ham bor.

232
00:12:40,659 --> 00:12:44,037
E, mentayko va pishlo birga mi?

233
00:12:44,060 --> 00:12:48,542
Ayol mijozlar orasida eng mashhuri aynan shu.

234
00:12:48,566 --> 00:12:51,766
Oddiy bilan qaysi biri tavsiya qilinadi?

235
00:12:51,789 --> 00:12:55,875
Spirtli ichimliklar bilan mentayko qoʻshilgani yaxshi ketadi.

236
00:12:55,898 --> 00:12:59,501
Unda, mentayko qoʻshilganini olamiz.

237
00:12:59,525 --> 00:13:01,558
Tushunarli.

238
00:13:01,581 --> 00:13:04,581
Albatta, juda mazali boʻladi!

239
00:13:04,604 --> 00:13:06,891
Endi shu lazzatini kutaman.

240
00:13:06,915 --> 00:13:09,558
Qovurilgan taomlar kerakmi?

241
00:13:09,581 --> 00:13:13,948
Qovurilgan taomlardan eng tavsiya qilinadigani qaysi?

242
00:13:13,971 --> 00:13:18,021
Oita mahsuloti boʻlgan Toritenni tavsiya qilaman.

243
00:13:18,044 --> 00:13:19,928
Toritenmi?

244
00:13:19,951 --> 00:13:22,728
Ponsu sousi bilan iste’mol qilinadigan taom.

245
00:13:22,752 --> 00:13:27,118
Juda yengil va nechta boʻlsada yeyaverasiz.

246
00:13:27,141 --> 00:13:29,427
Shuni ham bitta olamiz.

247
00:13:29,451 --> 00:13:31,522
Tushunarli.

248
00:13:31,546 --> 00:13:34,712
Ajoyib buyurtma berdingiz!

249
00:13:34,735 --> 00:13:36,235
7-Sahna: Buyurtma va allergiya moslashuvi / Buyurtma va allergiya moslamalari

250
00:13:36,235 --> 00:13:39,505
Buyurtmangizni qabul qilamiz.

251
00:13:39,529 --> 00:13:42,746
Bu chaxoxbili (guruchli taom)ni buyurtma qilmoqchiman.

252
00:13:42,769 --> 00:13:45,036
Guruchli besh turli masalliqli chaxoxbili.

253
00:13:45,059 --> 00:13:46,659
Rahmat.

254
00:13:46,682 --> 00:13:52,515
Uzr, bitta savolim bor: unda qisqichbaqa bormi?

255
00:13:52,538 --> 00:13:54,016
Ha.

256
00:13:54,039 --> 00:13:57,016
Masalliqlarida qisqichbaqa bor.

257
00:13:57,040 --> 00:14:01,573
Allergiyam bor, qisqichbaqa yeyolmayman.

258
00:14:01,596 --> 00:14:04,074
Ah, shundaymi.

259
00:14:04,098 --> 00:14:06,667
Allergiyangiz bor ekan.

260
00:14:06,690 --> 00:14:11,023
Qisqichbaqasiz tayyorlash mumkinmi?

261
00:14:11,046 --> 00:14:13,713
Biroz kutib turing.

262
00:14:13,736 --> 00:14:16,584
Oshxonaga borib soʻray kelaman.

263
00:14:16,608 --> 00:14:19,008
Biroz tashvish qildirdim, uzr.

264
00:14:19,031 --> 00:14:21,206
Iltimos.

265
00:14:21,230 --> 00:14:23,523
Kutingiz uchun uzr.

266
00:14:23,546 --> 00:14:27,152
Qisqichbaqasiz tayyorlash mumkin.

267
00:14:27,176 --> 00:14:29,109
Rostdanmi?

268
00:14:29,132 --> 00:14:31,099
Juda yaxshi boʻldi!

269
00:14:31,121 --> 00:14:34,855
Boshqa allergiya beradigan masalliqlar bormi?

270
00:14:34,878 --> 00:14:38,319
Tuxum va choʻchqa goʻshti muammo emas.

271
00:14:38,342 --> 00:14:40,709
Faqat qisqichbaqa va krab bilan muammo.

272
00:14:40,732 --> 00:14:42,776
Tushunarli.

273
00:14:42,799 --> 00:14:45,766
Qisqichbaqa qoʻshmaymiz.

274
00:14:45,789 --> 00:14:51,189
Piyozni ham ozroq yeyolmayman, kamroq qilish mumkinmi?

275
00:14:51,212 --> 00:14:55,412
Piyozsiz ham qilish mumkin, buni xohlaysizmi?

276
00:14:55,435 --> 00:14:59,132
Unda, piyozsiz ham qiling.

277
00:14:59,155 --> 00:15:01,355
Maʼlum boʻldi.

278
00:15:01,378 --> 00:15:04,580
Qisqichbaqa va piyozsiz, shundaymi?

279
00:15:04,604 --> 00:15:07,470
Biroz qiyinchilik tugʻdirdim, uzr.

280
00:15:07,493 --> 00:15:10,460
Yoʻq, hech qanday muammo yoʻq.

281
00:15:10,483 --> 00:15:14,449
Bunday mehribonlikdan juda xursand boʻldim.

282
00:15:14,472 --> 00:15:18,639
Salat sousida ham qisqichbaqa yoʻq.

283
00:15:18,662 --> 00:15:22,999
A, salat ham buyurtma qilmoqchi edim.

284
00:15:23,023 --> 00:15:27,037
Yaponcha sous, xavotir olmang.

285
00:15:27,061 --> 00:15:31,102
Unda, yaponcha salatni ham bitta qoʻshib qoʻying.

286
00:15:31,126 --> 00:15:33,292
Tushunarli.

287
00:15:33,315 --> 00:15:35,882
Salat va chaxoxbili, shundaymi?

288
00:15:35,905 --> 00:15:37,838
Iltimos.

289
00:15:37,861 --> 00:15:41,636
Mazali taom tayyorlayapman, iltimos kutib turing.

290
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:44,936
Ha, juda kutaman!

291
00:15:44,959 --> 00:15:46,459
Sahna 8: Taʼmga boʻlgan munosabat farqlari / Taʼm afzalliklaridagi farqlar

292
00:15:46,459 --> 00:15:51,426
Ovqatga boʻlgan did har bir kishida farq qiladi, shunday emasmi?

293
00:15:51,449 --> 00:15:53,715
Ha, shunday.

294
00:15:53,738 --> 00:15:57,154
Achchiq ovqatlarni yoqtirasizmi?

295
00:15:57,178 --> 00:15:59,850
Juda yaxshi koʻraman.

296
00:15:59,873 --> 00:16:04,806
Mabodoʻfu va koreys taomlarini yoqtiraman.

297
00:16:04,829 --> 00:16:06,966
Rostdanmi?

298
00:16:06,990 --> 00:16:11,556
Men achchiqni umuman yeyolmayman.

299
00:16:11,579 --> 00:16:16,398
Voy! Kimchi ham yeyolmaysizmi?

300
00:16:16,422 --> 00:16:21,467
Kimchi ham biroz achchiqroq boʻlib, yoqmaydi.

301
00:16:21,491 --> 00:16:23,749
Shunday ekan.

302
00:16:23,772 --> 00:16:28,439
Shirin yoki yengilroq taomlarni yoqtirasizmi?

303
00:16:28,462 --> 00:16:34,862
Ha, dashi taʼmli yapon taomlari va shirin souslarni yoqtiraman.

304
00:16:34,885 --> 00:16:36,697
Tushunarli.

305
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:41,287
Unda bugungi buyurtmaga eʼtibor berish kerak boʻladi.

306
00:16:41,310 --> 00:16:45,743
Achchiq taomlarni yolgʻiz yeyolasanmi?

307
00:16:45,766 --> 00:16:50,343
Bugun achchiq boʻlmagan taomni birga yeyishmiz kerak.

308
00:16:50,367 --> 00:16:52,537
Yaxshisiz.

309
00:16:52,561 --> 00:16:54,327
Rahmat.

310
00:16:54,350 --> 00:16:57,950
Shirin tuxum rulosini yoqtirasizmi?

311
00:16:57,974 --> 00:17:00,374
Juda yaxshi koʻraman.

312
00:17:00,397 --> 00:17:03,167
Onamning taʼmi kabi.

313
00:17:03,191 --> 00:17:05,357
Yaxshi ekan!

314
00:17:05,380 --> 00:17:09,047
Unda tuxum rulosini buyurtma qilamiz.

315
00:17:09,070 --> 00:17:13,758
Sushi yoki sashimi kabi xom baliqlarni yoqtirasizmi?

316
00:17:13,782 --> 00:17:16,348
Juda yaxshi koʻraman.

317
00:17:16,371 --> 00:17:18,938
Har kuni ham yeyishni xohlayman.

318
00:17:18,961 --> 00:17:23,928
Men ham sashimini juda yoqtiraman.

319
00:17:23,951 --> 00:17:26,448
Didlarimiz mos tushdi-ku!

320
00:17:26,471 --> 00:17:29,037
Yaxshi boʻldi!

321
00:17:29,060 --> 00:17:32,394
Men tuna va lososni yoqtiraman.

322
00:17:32,417 --> 00:17:36,428
Men oq baliqlarni afzal koʻraman.

323
00:17:36,452 --> 00:17:38,625
Masalan, ilonbaliq.

324
00:17:38,648 --> 00:17:41,541
Kattalar didi ekan.

325
00:17:41,564 --> 00:17:45,043
Bu bilan ichimlik ham yaxshi ketadi.

326
00:17:45,067 --> 00:17:50,123
Ichimliklar haqida gap ketganda, shirin kokteyllarni ichasizmi?

327
00:17:50,147 --> 00:17:53,580
Koʻp ichmayman.

328
00:17:53,603 --> 00:17:57,770
Men toza va yengil ulong choyi aralashmasini afzal koʻraman.

329
00:17:57,793 --> 00:18:03,726
Men shirin ume-shu va qora smorodina apelsinini yoqtiraman.

330
00:18:03,749 --> 00:18:08,116
Didlarimiz bir-birimizga teskari ekan, qiziqarli.

331
00:18:08,139 --> 00:18:13,141
Farqlar koʻp gapirishga imkon berib, qiziqarli boʻladi.

332
00:18:13,165 --> 00:18:15,131
Rostdan ham shunday.

333
00:18:15,154 --> 00:18:19,221
Bir-birimizga yoqtirgan joylarimizni aytib beramiz.

334
00:18:19,244 --> 00:18:21,653
Yaxshi ekan!

335
00:18:21,676 --> 00:18:26,692
Keyinroq sizga tavsiya qiladigan yapon taomlari restoranini aytaman.

336
00:18:26,716 --> 00:18:32,370
Men esa sizga juda achchiq taomlar taklif qiladigan joyni aytaman.

337
00:18:32,393 --> 00:18:36,843
Biroz yengillashtirib qoʻying, iltimos.

338
00:18:36,867 --> 00:18:38,367
Sahna 9: Taomni olib kelish va talablarni bajarish / Taomni xizmatga qoʻyish va soʻrovlarni bajarish

339
00:18:38,367 --> 00:18:41,700
Taomlaringizni olib keldik.

340
00:18:41,723 --> 00:18:44,456
Bu tovuq qovurma.

341
00:18:44,479 --> 00:18:48,213
Vov, juda mazali koʻrinadi!

342
00:18:48,236 --> 00:18:51,089
Rahmat.

343
00:18:51,112 --> 00:18:54,645
Iltimos, bemalol isteʼmol qiling.

344
00:18:54,668 --> 00:18:57,635
A, uzr.

345
00:18:57,658 --> 00:19:00,729
Biroz gaplashsak boʻladi mi?

346
00:19:00,752 --> 00:19:03,971
Ha, nima uchun?

347
00:19:03,995 --> 00:19:08,034
Iltimos, uchta likopcha olib keling.

348
00:19:08,058 --> 00:19:10,465
Tushunarli.

349
00:19:10,488 --> 00:19:13,505
Kichik likopchalarni uchta, shundaymi?

350
00:19:13,528 --> 00:19:20,128
Keyin, qoshiqni polga tushirib yubordim, iltimos, almashtirib bering.

351
00:19:20,151 --> 00:19:22,793
Kechirasiz, juda uzr.

352
00:19:22,817 --> 00:19:26,502
Yangi qoshiq olib kelaman.

353
00:19:26,526 --> 00:19:28,159
Rahmat.

354
00:19:28,182 --> 00:19:30,061
Juda yaxshi boʻldi!

355
00:19:30,084 --> 00:19:33,781
Suv uchun stakan ham qoʻshib qoʻysam boʻladi mi?

356
00:19:33,805 --> 00:19:38,405
A, boʻsh stakanlardan ikkitasini berishingiz mumkinmi?

357
00:19:38,428 --> 00:19:42,299
Butilka pivoni boʻlish uchun stakan, shundaymi?

358
00:19:42,323 --> 00:19:45,256
Ha, aynan.

359
00:19:45,279 --> 00:19:47,967
Kichikroq stakan yaxshiroq boʻlardi.

360
00:19:47,990 --> 00:19:50,364
Tushunarli.

361
00:19:50,388 --> 00:19:53,668
Darhol tayyorlab beraman.

362
00:19:53,691 --> 00:19:57,191
Sochiq yoki salfetkalar ham qoʻshib berish mumkinmi?

363
00:19:57,214 --> 00:20:03,393
Ha, yangi iliq salfetka olib kelaman.

364
00:20:03,417 --> 00:20:05,670
Koʻp narsalar uchun rahmat.

365
00:20:05,693 --> 00:20:09,761
Arzimaydi, xech qisiqmasangiz.

366
00:20:09,784 --> 00:20:15,879
Bu oshxonaning xodimlari hammasi mehribon va tez ishlaydilar-ku.

367
00:20:15,903 --> 00:20:17,480
Rahmat.

368
00:20:17,504 --> 00:20:21,937
Taom sovib ketmasdan hammamiz boʻlib yeyishni xohlaymiz.

369
00:20:21,960 --> 00:20:25,794
Shoshilinch olib kelaman.

370
00:20:25,817 --> 00:20:27,217
Iltimos.

371
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:29,406
Kutingizni oldim.

372
00:20:29,429 --> 00:20:33,232
Bu yerda kichik likopchalar va qoshiqlar.

373
00:20:33,255 --> 00:20:35,455
Tez boʻldingiz-ku!

374
00:20:35,478 --> 00:20:37,083
Rahmat.

375
00:20:37,107 --> 00:20:41,641
Stakan va salfetkalarni ham shu yerga qoʻyaman.

376
00:20:41,664 --> 00:20:43,464
Ajoyib!

377
00:20:43,487 --> 00:20:46,053
Rostdan ham katta rahmat.

378
00:20:46,076 --> 00:20:50,043
Yana biror narsa kerakmi?

379
00:20:50,066 --> 00:20:53,320
Hozircha hammasi joyida.

380
00:20:53,344 --> 00:20:55,477
Keyinroq chaqiraman.

381
00:20:55,500 --> 00:20:57,000
10-SAHNA: Band oshxonada buyurtmalarni bajarish / Band smenada buyurtmalarni qabul qilish

382
00:20:57,000 --> 00:21:02,283
Sakkiz boʻldi, oshxona toʻlib ketdi-ku.

383
00:21:02,306 --> 00:21:06,139
Buyurtma qoʻngʻiroqlari koʻp chalinyapti.

384
00:21:06,162 --> 00:21:08,329
Band boʻldik.

385
00:21:08,352 --> 00:21:13,285
Vaziyatga koʻra, birma-bir buyurtmalarni bajaraylik.

386
00:21:13,308 --> 00:21:14,978
Ha.

387
00:21:15,002 --> 00:21:19,294
Ichimliklar buyurtmasi oʻn dona toʻplangan.

388
00:21:19,317 --> 00:21:23,656
Men pivo va xaybol tayyorlayman.

389
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:29,113
Men esa kvas va alkogolsiz ichimliklarga mas’ul boʻlaman.

390
00:21:29,136 --> 00:21:31,108
Juda yaxshi boʻldi!

391
00:21:31,132 --> 00:21:34,066
Boʻlib olib, tezroq chiqaramiz.

392
00:21:34,089 --> 00:21:39,691
Taom yetkazib berishda biroz kechikayotgan stol bor.

393
00:21:39,714 --> 00:21:41,650
Qaysi stol?

394
00:21:41,674 --> 00:21:43,956
Tasdiqlab kelaman.

395
00:21:43,979 --> 00:21:47,913
Beshinchi va sakkizinchi stollar.

396
00:21:47,936 --> 00:21:52,829
Oshpazga aytib, tezroq tayyorlashlarini soʻrayman.

397
00:21:52,852 --> 00:21:54,386
Iltimos.

398
00:21:54,408 --> 00:21:58,105
Men esa mijozlarga uzr soʻrab kelaman.

399
00:21:58,128 --> 00:22:01,220
Ajoyib gʻamxoʻrlik!

400
00:22:01,243 --> 00:22:03,721
Iltimos.

401
00:22:03,745 --> 00:22:07,155
Uf, ter chiqib ketdi.

402
00:22:07,179 --> 00:22:09,857
Juda band boʻldik-ku.

403
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:14,214
Hozir eng qiyin vaqt.

404
00:22:14,237 --> 00:22:15,903
Saqlab qolaylik!

405
00:22:15,927 --> 00:22:17,527
Ha.

406
00:22:17,550 --> 00:22:21,583
Siz bilan ishlash juda qulay.

407
00:22:21,606 --> 00:22:23,940
Men ham siz bilan ishlashdan mamnunman.

408
00:22:23,963 --> 00:22:26,849
Tabassumingiz juda chiroyli.

409
00:22:26,872 --> 00:22:31,141
Mijozlarga ham tabassum bilan xizmat qilishni davom ettiramiz.

410
00:22:31,165 --> 00:22:34,698
Yana bir soatdan keyin boʻshashamiz.

411
00:22:34,721 --> 00:22:38,755
Yaxshi, endi kuch-quvvat bilan ishlaymiz!

412
00:22:38,778 --> 00:22:42,978
Ichimliklarni toʻldirishni unutmang, iltimos.

413
00:22:43,001 --> 00:22:45,968
Muz va stakanlarni toʻldirish kerak.

414
00:22:45,991 --> 00:22:47,991
Tushunarli.

415
00:22:48,014 --> 00:22:52,581
Jarohat olmasligingizga eʼtibor bering, iltimos.

416
00:22:52,604 --> 00:22:53,694
Ha.

417
00:22:53,718 --> 00:22:56,596
Oyoq ostimga eʼtibor berib yuguraman.

418
00:22:56,619 --> 00:23:00,452
Yugurmasdan, tezroq boramiz.

419
00:23:00,475 --> 00:23:02,922
A, shunday edi.

420
00:23:02,946 --> 00:23:05,749
Xavfsizlik birinchi oʻrin!

421
00:23:05,773 --> 00:23:10,573
Eng gavjum vaqt oʻtgandan keyin, mazali xodimlar taomini yeyishimiz kerak.

422
00:23:10,596 --> 00:23:13,596
Shunga umid qilib, harakat qilaman.

423
00:23:13,619 --> 00:23:17,352
Qani endi ichimlik tayyor!

424
00:23:17,375 --> 00:23:19,215
Olib keting.

425
00:23:19,238 --> 00:23:20,972
Ha.

426
00:23:20,995 --> 00:23:23,079
Ketyapman.

427
00:23:23,102 --> 00:23:24,602
11-Sahna: Buyurtmalarni kechikishiga javob berish / Buyurtmalarni kechikishini hal qilish

428
00:23:24,602 --> 00:23:27,136
Meni chaqirdingizmi?

429
00:23:27,159 --> 00:23:29,042
Sizga yordam berishim mumkin.

430
00:23:29,065 --> 00:23:30,798
Kechirasiz,

431
00:23:30,821 --> 00:23:35,291
30 daqiqa oldin buyurtma qilgan taomim hali kelmadi.

432
00:23:35,315 --> 00:23:38,205
Kechirasiz, juda uzr.

433
00:23:38,229 --> 00:23:41,029
Qaysi taom edi?

434
00:23:41,052 --> 00:23:45,018
Yakitori assortisi va yakisoba.

435
00:23:45,041 --> 00:23:49,061
Yakitori assortisi va yakisoba, shundaymi?

436
00:23:49,085 --> 00:23:51,485
Tekshirib koʻraman.

437
00:23:51,508 --> 00:23:56,593
Ichimliklar tez keldi, lekin taom kechikdi.

438
00:23:56,616 --> 00:24:00,435
Kechikkanimiz uchun uzr soʻraymiz.

439
00:24:00,459 --> 00:24:06,026
Hozirgi holatni oshxonaga soʻrab koʻrsangiz boʻladi mi?

440
00:24:06,049 --> 00:24:09,827
Ha, darhol oshxonaga borib tekshirib kelaman.

441
00:24:09,850 --> 00:24:12,417
Biroz kutib turing.

442
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:15,046
Ha, iltimos.

443
00:24:15,070 --> 00:24:17,403
Kutib turganingiz uchun uzr.

444
00:24:17,426 --> 00:24:20,517
Oshxonaga borib tekshirib keldim.

445
00:24:20,540 --> 00:24:22,507
Qanday boʻldi?

446
00:24:22,530 --> 00:24:25,497
Buyurtma qabul qilinganmi edi?

447
00:24:25,520 --> 00:24:28,855
Ha, buyurtma qabul qilingan.

448
00:24:28,878 --> 00:24:31,337
Yaxshi boʻldi.

449
00:24:31,360 --> 00:24:34,493
Yana qancha vaqt kerak boʻladi?

450
00:24:34,516 --> 00:24:39,250
Yakitori hozir aynan pishib chiqmoqda.

451
00:24:39,273 --> 00:24:42,406
Taxminan 5 daqiqa ichida keladi, degani?

452
00:24:42,429 --> 00:24:45,796
Ha, 3 daqiqa ichida olib kelamiz.

453
00:24:45,818 --> 00:24:48,652
Yakisoba holati qanday?

454
00:24:48,675 --> 00:24:52,716
Yakisoba esa hozir tayyorlanmoqda.

455
00:24:52,740 --> 00:24:56,176
E, hozirgina boshlaysizmi?

456
00:24:56,199 --> 00:24:59,135
Vaqt ketadi, koʻrinadi.

457
00:24:59,158 --> 00:25:04,246
Juda gavjum boʻlib, navbat kechikdi.

458
00:25:04,270 --> 00:25:09,470
Oxirgi elektr poyezdi bor, shuning uchun yakisobani bekor qilishim mumkinmi?

459
00:25:09,493 --> 00:25:14,826
Ha, hali tayyorlanmagan, bekor qilish mumkin.

460
00:25:14,849 --> 00:25:18,538
Unda, yakisobani bekor qiling, iltimos.

461
00:25:18,562 --> 00:25:20,728
Tushunarli.

462
00:25:20,751 --> 00:25:23,446
Kechirasiz, juda uzr.

463
00:25:23,470 --> 00:25:27,637
Yoʻq, tekshirib berganingiz uchun rahmat.

464
00:25:27,660 --> 00:25:32,326
Yakitorini tezda olib kelamiz, biroz kutib turing.

465
00:25:32,349 --> 00:25:35,202
Yaxshi, iltimos.

466
00:25:35,226 --> 00:25:38,593
Ҳақиқатдан узр сўрайман.

467
00:25:38,616 --> 00:25:40,683
Кечирасиз.

468
00:25:40,706 --> 00:25:43,106
Ҳа, тушундим.

469
00:25:43,129 --> 00:25:44,629
12-сахна: Бошliq гапни эшитиб, қийналган ҳолат / Бошliqдан қийналув ҳақида гаплашиш

470
00:25:44,629 --> 00:25:48,596
Бугун ҳам арақ яхши кетади-ку!

471
00:25:48,619 --> 00:25:51,638
Нимадир бўлганми?

472
00:25:51,661 --> 00:25:57,541
Аслида, бугун ишда бошлиғим мага қизиб кетди.

473
00:25:57,565 --> 00:26:01,531
Ростданми?!

474
00:26:01,554 --> 00:26:04,521
Жуда қийин бўлди-ку.

475
00:26:04,544 --> 00:26:09,477
Менинг хатоим бўлмаса ҳам, менга қизиб юборди.

476
00:26:09,500 --> 00:26:12,467
Бу жуда адолатсиз-ку!

477
00:26:12,490 --> 00:26:15,523
Нима бўлган-да?

478
00:26:15,546 --> 00:26:22,595
Ҳужжатдаги рақамлар нотўғри экан, деб гапиради, лекин мен яратган эмасман-ку.

479
00:26:22,619 --> 00:26:25,266
Бу жуда адолатсиз!

480
00:26:25,290 --> 00:26:28,544
Тўғри жавоб қайтардингизми?

481
00:26:28,567 --> 00:26:34,034
Бошлиғим жуда қўрқинч эди, ҳеч нарса деёлмадим.

482
00:26:34,057 --> 00:26:39,623
Уф, бу ҳафачиликни мен яхши тушунаман.

483
00:26:39,646 --> 00:26:43,695
Ижара хонасида ёмон гап айтиб қўйдим, узр.

484
00:26:43,718 --> 00:26:51,966
Йўқ-йўқ! Бундай вақтларда ёмон гап айтиш учун эмасми, ижара хонаси бор.

485
00:26:51,990 --> 00:26:55,390
Бу гапни эшитиб, менга жуда хуш бўлди.

486
00:26:55,413 --> 00:26:59,413
Кўп ичиб, ёмон ҳолларни унутиб юборинг!

487
00:26:59,436 --> 00:27:04,330
Ҳа, бугун ҳаддан ташкари ичиш истайман.

488
00:27:04,353 --> 00:27:10,330
Иш жойидаги инсонлар билан муносабат жуда қийин-ку.

489
00:27:10,354 --> 00:27:12,754
Ҳақиқатан ҳам шундай.

490
00:27:12,777 --> 00:27:15,835
Жуда кўп ўйлаб, чарчайман.

491
00:27:15,859 --> 00:27:22,625
Мен ҳам ўтган ҳафта кейингиларга ўргатишда қийналар эдим.

492
00:27:22,649 --> 00:27:24,905
Ростми?

493
00:27:24,928 --> 00:27:27,220
Қандай қийинчиликлар бор эди?

494
00:27:27,244 --> 00:27:32,777
Неча марта ўргатсам ҳам, доим бир хил хато қилиб қўяди.

495
00:27:32,800 --> 00:27:35,457
Бу ҳам қийин-ку.

496
00:27:35,481 --> 00:27:38,374
Ўргатиш ҳам қийин.

497
00:27:38,398 --> 00:27:43,931
Яхшилик билан айтсам ҳам фойдаси йўқ, қаттиқ айтсам ҳам тушунмайди.

498
00:27:43,954 --> 00:27:48,154
Иккаламизга ҳам ишда қийинчиликлар кўп экан-ку.

499
00:27:48,177 --> 00:27:54,196
Айнан шу сабабдан, бундай ҳолларда гаплашиш энг яхши даво.

500
00:27:54,219 --> 00:27:55,875
Rostdan ham shunday.

501
00:27:55,898 --> 00:27:59,065
Ҳозир ҳолат бирмунча енгиллашди.

502
00:27:59,088 --> 00:28:02,964
Сиз ҳар доим жуда ҳаракат қиласиз.

503
00:28:02,987 --> 00:28:05,620
Мен буни биламан.

504
00:28:05,643 --> 00:28:07,377
Rahmat.

505
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:09,933
Ёшим келиб қолди.

506
00:28:09,956 --> 00:28:14,974
Келинг, кулиб, ҳайболни ичайлик!

507
00:28:14,997 --> 00:28:18,266
Ҳа, энди қувонч келди.

508
00:28:18,289 --> 00:28:20,746
Яна бир бор тилак қиламиз!

509
00:28:20,770 --> 00:28:22,807
Yaxshi ekan!

510
00:28:22,830 --> 00:28:27,275
Тилак! Эртага ҳам ҳаракат қиламиз!

511
00:28:27,298 --> 00:28:28,432
Тилак!

512
00:28:28,455 --> 00:28:31,655
Эртадан бошлаб янгидан бошлаймиз!

513
00:28:31,678 --> 00:28:33,178
13-сахна: Пиво қуйиш усули / Пивони тўғри қуйиш

514
00:28:33,178 --> 00:28:37,611
А, стакан бўш эканини кўрмадим.

515
00:28:37,634 --> 00:28:40,434
О, ростдан ҳам.

516
00:28:40,457 --> 00:28:42,955
Сезиб қолмадим.

517
00:28:42,978 --> 00:28:46,469
Пиво қуйиб қўяйми?

518
00:28:46,493 --> 00:28:48,426
Rahmat.

519
00:28:48,449 --> 00:28:51,886
Раҳмат, меҳрибонлик учун.

520
00:28:51,910 --> 00:28:55,357
Yoʻq, yoʻq, iltimos, oʻtiring!

521
00:28:55,380 --> 00:28:58,317
Stakaning ikkala qoʻlingiz bilan ushlab turing.

522
00:28:58,341 --> 00:29:01,360
Yaxshi, ichaman.

523
00:29:01,383 --> 00:29:03,817
To-to-to…

524
00:29:03,840 --> 00:29:07,293
Kopikning nisbati aynan mos keldi!

525
00:29:07,316 --> 00:29:10,049
Juda yaxshi chiqardi!

526
00:29:10,072 --> 00:29:13,041
Kopiklari pufakdek yumshoq.

527
00:29:13,065 --> 00:29:17,799
Avvalroq, yarim kunlik ishda quyishni mashq qilar edim.

528
00:29:17,823 --> 00:29:19,589
Tushunarli.

529
00:29:19,612 --> 00:29:22,346
Professional uslub ekan!

530
00:29:22,369 --> 00:29:24,056
Rahmat.

531
00:29:24,079 --> 00:29:28,365
Sizning stakaningiz ham kamayib ketmaganmi?

532
00:29:28,389 --> 00:29:31,227
Ha, rostini aytsangiz.

533
00:29:31,250 --> 00:29:34,823
Keyin nima ichamiz?

534
00:29:34,846 --> 00:29:38,646
Men sake ichishni xohlardim.

535
00:29:38,669 --> 00:29:41,269
Juda yaxshi!

536
00:29:41,292 --> 00:29:45,177
Sovuq sake va issiq sake, qaysi birini tanlaysiz?

537
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:48,434
Tozalovchi sovuq sake yaxshi.

538
00:29:48,457 --> 00:29:53,590
Unda, bu yerda tavsiya qilinadigan mahalliy sake buyurtma qilamiz.

539
00:29:53,613 --> 00:29:55,646
Quvnoq boʻldim!

540
00:29:55,669 --> 00:29:59,069
Birga kichik stakanlarda ichamiz.

541
00:29:59,092 --> 00:30:00,930
Yaxshi ekan!

542
00:30:00,954 --> 00:30:04,687
Men ham sake bilan birga olaman.

543
00:30:04,710 --> 00:30:08,244
Ofitsantni chaqirib, buyurtma beramiz.

544
00:30:08,267 --> 00:30:11,556
Men chaqiraman!

545
00:30:11,579 --> 00:30:13,594
Kechirasiz!

546
00:30:13,618 --> 00:30:16,418
Ishonchli ekansiz.

547
00:30:16,441 --> 00:30:17,974
Rahmat.

548
00:30:17,997 --> 00:30:22,476
Spirtli ichimliklarni oʻz tempingizda iching.

549
00:30:22,500 --> 00:30:23,700
Ha.

550
00:30:23,723 --> 00:30:26,372
Keraksiz zoʻriqmaslikka harakat qilaman.

551
00:30:26,396 --> 00:30:29,762
Suv ham birga ichish yaxshiroq.

552
00:30:29,785 --> 00:30:31,472
Ha, shunday.

553
00:30:31,496 --> 00:30:34,229
Sovuq suv ham buyurtma qilamiz.

554
00:30:34,252 --> 00:30:39,019
Spirtli ichimlik bilan suvni birga ichsangiz, mast boʻlmaysiz.

555
00:30:39,042 --> 00:30:41,910
Gʻamxoʻrlik ajoyib ekan!

556
00:30:41,934 --> 00:30:44,136
Albatta.

557
00:30:44,159 --> 00:30:48,559
Bir-birimiz bilan oxirigacha zavqlanib ichishni xohlaymiz.

558
00:30:48,582 --> 00:30:50,052
Ha.

559
00:30:50,075 --> 00:30:54,146
Mazali sake ni sekin-asta tatib koʻraylik.

560
00:30:54,170 --> 00:30:58,103
Endi, sake kelishini kutamiz.

561
00:30:58,126 --> 00:30:59,626
14-Sahna: Xashak tushirib yuborganda qanday javob berish kerak / Xashakni tushirib yuborganda nima qilish kerak

562
00:30:59,626 --> 00:31:05,460
Oy, tushirib yubordim! Qars!

563
00:31:05,483 --> 00:31:07,449
Yaxshimisiz?

564
00:31:07,472 --> 00:31:10,289
Jarohat olmadingizmi?

565
00:31:10,313 --> 00:31:12,679
Kechirasiz.

566
00:31:12,702 --> 00:31:16,969
Qoʻlimdan sirgʻalib, xashakni tushirib yubordim.

567
00:31:16,992 --> 00:31:19,625
Jarohat olmaganingiz yaxshi.

568
00:31:19,648 --> 00:31:23,892
Polni iflos qilib qoʻydim, uzr.

569
00:31:23,916 --> 00:31:28,149
Yoʻq, yoʻq, shunday qoldiring.

570
00:31:28,172 --> 00:31:31,006
Oʻzim teraman.

571
00:31:31,030 --> 00:31:36,563
Yoʻq, men teraman, siz oʻtiring.

572
00:31:36,586 --> 00:31:38,675
Kechirasiz.

573
00:31:38,698 --> 00:31:41,196
Biroz tashvish qildirdim, uzr.

574
00:31:41,220 --> 00:31:45,153
Yangi xashak olib kelaman.

575
00:31:45,176 --> 00:31:46,870
Rahmat.

576
00:31:46,893 --> 00:31:49,103
Juda yaxshi boʻldi!

577
00:31:49,127 --> 00:31:54,096
Yarim xashak va plastik xashak, qaysi biri yaxshi?

578
00:31:54,120 --> 00:31:58,920
Yarim xashak sirgʻalmaydi, shuning uchun afzalroq.

579
00:31:58,943 --> 00:32:01,277
Tushunarli.

580
00:32:01,301 --> 00:32:04,556
Yarim xashak olib kelaman.

581
00:32:04,579 --> 00:32:08,746
Taom kiyimimga toʻkilib ketmaganligini xohlardim.

582
00:32:08,769 --> 00:32:12,102
Kiyimingiz ifloslanmaganmi?

583
00:32:12,125 --> 00:32:15,658
Salfetkalarni ochib... ishlatmoqchimisiz?

584
00:32:15,681 --> 00:32:18,615
Kiyimim yaxshi holatda edi.

585
00:32:18,638 --> 00:32:21,371
Salfetka berishingiz mumkinmi?

586
00:32:21,394 --> 00:32:23,194
Ha.

587
00:32:23,217 --> 00:32:27,307
Ha, darhol yangi salfetka va xashaklaringizni olib kelaman.

588
00:32:27,331 --> 00:32:30,698
Tez javob berganingiz uchun rahmat.

589
00:32:30,721 --> 00:32:34,054
Kutingiz uchun uzr.

590
00:32:34,077 --> 00:32:38,124
Bu yerda bir martalik xashak va salfetkalar.

591
00:32:38,147 --> 00:32:41,186
Rostdan ham katta rahmat.

592
00:32:41,210 --> 00:32:45,850
Polni ham toza artdik, xavotir olmang.

593
00:32:45,873 --> 00:32:50,916
Mehribonligingizdan yuragim isindi.

594
00:32:50,940 --> 00:32:55,906
Ovqatlanayotganingizda bezovta qilib qoʻydim, uzr.

595
00:32:55,929 --> 00:33:01,063
Yoʻq, men xashakni tushirib yuborganim sabab boʻldi.

596
00:33:01,086 --> 00:33:05,864
Iltimos, ovqatingiz sovib ketmasdan oldin yeying.

597
00:33:05,887 --> 00:33:07,499
Ha.

598
00:33:07,523 --> 00:33:10,956
Ha, endi tushirmaslikka harakat qilaman.

599
00:33:10,979 --> 00:33:14,412
Ovqatingizdan sekin-asta zavqlaning.

600
00:33:14,436 --> 00:33:15,936
Rahmat!

601
00:33:15,959 --> 00:33:17,892
Ovqatlanayapman.

602
00:33:17,915 --> 00:33:20,250
Sekin-asta ovqatlaning.

603
00:33:20,274 --> 00:33:21,774
15-Sahna: Mijozlarga xizmat koʻrsatishda muammolarni hal qilish

604
00:33:21,774 --> 00:33:25,830
Doʻkon mudiri, hozir ozgina vaqt bormi?

605
00:33:25,853 --> 00:33:27,630
Nima boʻldi?

606
00:33:27,653 --> 00:33:30,387
Biror muammo yuz berdimi?

607
00:33:30,410 --> 00:33:36,666
Ha, 3-raqamli stolning mijozlari stakan sindirib qoʻyishdi.

608
00:33:36,689 --> 00:33:40,907
Yaxshiyamki, hech kim jarohat olmaganmi?

609
00:33:40,930 --> 00:33:44,697
Ha, hech kim jarohat olmagan.

610
00:33:44,720 --> 00:33:46,886
Bu yaxshi yangilik.

611
00:33:46,909 --> 00:33:49,983
Qanday vaziyat?

612
00:33:50,006 --> 00:33:56,140
Qizil sharob solingan stakanda, polga va kiyimga biroz toʻkilib ketdi.

613
00:33:56,163 --> 00:34:00,298
Kiyimga ham toʻkilib ketgan ekan.

614
00:34:00,321 --> 00:34:02,593
Bu juda yomon.

615
00:34:02,617 --> 00:34:06,687
Mijoz juda uzr soʻrayotgan edi.

616
00:34:06,710 --> 00:34:11,710
Tezda tozalash asboblari va nam salfetkalarni olib kelaylik.

617
00:34:11,733 --> 00:34:16,300
Ha, supurgi va changyutgichni tayyorladim.

618
00:34:16,323 --> 00:34:21,540
Yaxshi, shisha parchalari tarqalib ketgan, xavfli ekan.

619
00:34:21,564 --> 00:34:25,164
Men supurgi bilan parchalarni yigʻaman.

620
00:34:25,187 --> 00:34:30,154
Men oʻz mijozimning kiyim holatini tekshirib, uzr soʻrayman.

621
00:34:30,177 --> 00:34:34,444
Doʻkonda tozalash xarajatlarini toʻlaymizmi?

622
00:34:34,467 --> 00:34:39,151
Vaziyatga qarab, kerak boʻlsa, biznes kartamizni berib hal qilamiz.

623
00:34:39,174 --> 00:34:40,941
Tushunarli.

624
00:34:40,964 --> 00:34:43,862
Sovushib harakat qilamiz.

625
00:34:43,885 --> 00:34:48,328
Boshqa mijozlar shisha ustiga bosmasligi uchun yoʻl koʻrsatib qoʻying.

626
00:34:48,352 --> 00:34:53,152
Ha, yon stolning mijozlariga ham murojaat qilaman.

627
00:34:53,175 --> 00:34:55,988
Ajoyib harakat qilayapsiz.

628
00:34:56,011 --> 00:34:58,302
Tezroq harakat qilaylik.

629
00:34:58,326 --> 00:35:02,260
Yangi ichimlikni qanday xizmat qilamiz?

630
00:35:02,283 --> 00:35:06,090
Xuddi shu sharobni bepul bir stakan taklif qilaylik.

631
00:35:06,114 --> 00:35:08,388
Tushunarli.

632
00:35:08,411 --> 00:35:10,744
Tayyorlab qoʻyaman.

633
00:35:10,767 --> 00:35:15,134
Jarohat yoʻqligi eng muhimi, lekin samimiyatimizni koʻrsatishimiz kerak.

634
00:35:15,157 --> 00:35:19,290
Ha, doʻkon mudiri yonimda ekanligingizdan yordam berdingiz.

635
00:35:19,313 --> 00:35:23,932
Siz tez xabar berganingiz uchun.

636
00:35:23,956 --> 00:35:25,694
Rahmat.

637
00:35:25,717 --> 00:35:28,284
Endi ketamiz.

638
00:35:28,307 --> 00:35:32,473
Yaxshi, 3-stolga boring.

639
00:35:32,496 --> 00:35:35,173
Oyoqlaringizga e’tibor bering.

640
00:35:35,197 --> 00:35:36,730
Tushunarli.

641
00:35:36,753 --> 00:35:38,320
Rahmat.

642
00:35:38,343 --> 00:35:39,843
16-Sahna: Tanaffus oldi topshirigʻi / Tanaffusdan oldin topshirish

643
00:35:39,843 --> 00:35:45,939
Band vaqt oʻtib, endi tinchroq boʻldi.

644
00:35:45,962 --> 00:35:49,296
Ikki soat davomida shiddatli edi.

645
00:35:49,319 --> 00:35:54,588
Endi men qirq besh daqiqa dam olaman.

646
00:35:54,611 --> 00:35:56,814
Ishdan chiqqaningiz uchun rahmat.

647
00:35:56,837 --> 00:35:59,371
Yaxshi dam oling.

648
00:35:59,394 --> 00:36:04,194
Dam olishdan oldin bir necha narsani topshirib ketaman.

649
00:36:04,217 --> 00:36:05,617
Ha.

650
00:36:05,640 --> 00:36:07,848
Daftarga yozib olaman.

651
00:36:07,872 --> 00:36:09,479
Iltimos.

652
00:36:09,503 --> 00:36:14,669
Avvalo, 2-stoldagi mijoz desert kutmoqda.

653
00:36:14,692 --> 00:36:20,492
Qanday desert buyurtma bergan? Ikki dona vanil muzqaymoq.

654
00:36:20,516 --> 00:36:22,716
Besh daqiqadan keyin chiqaring.

655
00:36:22,739 --> 00:36:24,506
Tushunarli.

656
00:36:24,529 --> 00:36:27,529
Besh daqiqadan keyin vanil muzqaymoq, shundaymi?

657
00:36:27,552 --> 00:36:32,952
Keyin, 7-stoldagi hisob-kitob alohida-alohida.

658
00:36:32,975 --> 00:36:35,608
Boʻlishib toʻlash hisob-kitobi.

659
00:36:35,631 --> 00:36:38,110
Kassada hal qilaman.

660
00:36:38,133 --> 00:36:42,300
Chekda yozuv bor, tekshirib koʻring.

661
00:36:42,323 --> 00:36:44,368
Tushunarli.

662
00:36:44,392 --> 00:36:47,025
Xatoga yoʻl qoʻymayman.

663
00:36:47,048 --> 00:36:51,181
Oshxonaning oxirgi buyurtmasi soat oʻn yarimda.

664
00:36:51,204 --> 00:36:54,173
Endi oʻttiz daqiqa qoldi.

665
00:36:54,196 --> 00:36:57,455
Mijozlarga aytib qoʻyaymi?

666
00:36:57,478 --> 00:37:02,965
Oʻn besh daqiqa qolganda barcha stollarga aytib qoʻying.

667
00:37:02,989 --> 00:37:06,789
Soat oʻn birda oxirgi buyurtmani tasdiqlash kerak.

668
00:37:06,812 --> 00:37:08,145
Ha.

669
00:37:08,168 --> 00:37:10,301
Iltimos.

670
00:37:10,324 --> 00:37:13,821
Zal ichidagi ichimliklar toʻldirildi-mi?

671
00:37:13,845 --> 00:37:18,578
Pivo serverining bochkasi yangi almashtirildi.

672
00:37:18,601 --> 00:37:21,010
Haqiqatan ham siz tajribali ekansiz.

673
00:37:21,034 --> 00:37:22,800
Mukammal.

674
00:37:22,823 --> 00:37:24,390
Rahmat.

675
00:37:24,413 --> 00:37:29,780
Agar muammo boʻlsa, dam olish xonasining eshigini taqillating.

676
00:37:29,803 --> 00:37:31,662
Muammo yo‘q.

677
00:37:31,685 --> 00:37:34,454
Yolgʻiz oʻzim zalni qoʻriqlayman!

678
00:37:34,478 --> 00:37:36,711
Ishonchli ekansiz.

679
00:37:36,734 --> 00:37:39,380
Ovqatlanib kelaman.

680
00:37:39,404 --> 00:37:41,970
Bugungi ovqat nima?

681
00:37:41,993 --> 00:37:46,193
Oshpazning maxsus ulkan karri guruchi.

682
00:37:46,216 --> 00:37:48,829
Vaa, yaxshi ekan.

683
00:37:48,853 --> 00:37:51,228
Yaxshi dam oling.

684
00:37:51,251 --> 00:37:55,017
Hehe, siz uchun ham qoldirib qoʻyaman.

685
00:37:55,040 --> 00:37:58,574
Yaxshi! Ketdingiz!

686
00:37:58,597 --> 00:38:00,097
17-Sahna: Koʻp ovqatlanish va ortiqcha ovqat / Koʻp ovqatlanish va ortiqcha qolgan ovqat

687
00:38:00,097 --> 00:38:04,330
Uf, qorni toʻldi.

688
00:38:04,353 --> 00:38:08,720
Mening ham qorni toʻldi.

689
00:38:08,743 --> 00:38:13,958
Lekin stol ustida hali ovqat qolgan-ku.

690
00:38:13,981 --> 00:38:18,548
Dastlab juda koʻp buyurtma berib qoʻydik.

691
00:38:18,572 --> 00:38:22,105
Tovuq qovurma hali uch dona bor.

692
00:38:22,128 --> 00:38:26,895
Bu tovuq qovurma haqiqatan ham katta ekan.

693
00:38:26,918 --> 00:38:30,884
Siz yana ozgina yeyolmaysizmi?

694
00:38:30,907 --> 00:38:36,197
Ha, men ham anchagina qiynalyapman.

695
00:38:36,221 --> 00:38:38,587
Iltimos.

696
00:38:38,610 --> 00:38:41,589
Yana ikkitasini yeb qoʻying, iltimos.

697
00:38:41,613 --> 00:38:48,782
Hmm, mazali koʻrinadi, lekin sigʻadimi? Qoldirish aybdur.

698
00:38:48,805 --> 00:38:53,051
Ha, ovqatni qoldirish yaxshi emas-ku.

699
00:38:53,075 --> 00:38:58,694
Siz erkaksiz, hali oshqozoningizda joy bor boʻladi-ku.

700
00:38:58,717 --> 00:39:00,559
Tushunarli.

701
00:39:00,583 --> 00:39:03,762
Bitta boʻlsada, zoʻr berib yeyman.

702
00:39:03,785 --> 00:39:07,857
Bitta emas, ikkitasini yeb qoʻying-ku! ~

703
00:39:07,880 --> 00:39:11,897
Unda limon sepib, salqinroq qilaylik.

704
00:39:11,921 --> 00:39:13,854
Yaxshi fikr.

705
00:39:13,877 --> 00:39:17,337
Limon sepilsa, yeyish osonroq boʻladi.

706
00:39:17,360 --> 00:39:19,219
Bitta yedim.

707
00:39:19,242 --> 00:39:22,132
Qarsillab, mazali ekan-ku!

708
00:39:22,156 --> 00:39:23,650
Vay, ajoyib!

709
00:39:23,673 --> 00:39:27,307
Unda men ham oxirgi bitasini zoʻr berib yeyman.

710
00:39:27,330 --> 00:39:30,977
E, zoʻrlamang, muammo yoʻq-ku.

711
00:39:31,000 --> 00:39:33,833
Faqat sizni zoʻrlamaymiz-ku.

712
00:39:33,856 --> 00:39:35,990
Men ham yeyman.

713
00:39:36,013 --> 00:39:39,246
Hehe, yutqazishni xohlamaysiz-ku.

714
00:39:39,269 --> 00:39:41,343
Ovqatlanayapman.

715
00:39:41,367 --> 00:39:45,204
Hmm, qiyin, lekin mazali ekan.

716
00:39:45,227 --> 00:39:48,560
Men ham yana bitasini yeb boʻldim-ku.

717
00:39:48,583 --> 00:39:51,067
Yaxshi qildik-ku!

718
00:39:51,090 --> 00:39:53,724
Tovoq toza boʻlib qoldi.

719
00:39:53,748 --> 00:39:56,415
Toʻliq yeb boʻldik-ku!

720
00:39:56,438 --> 00:39:59,004
Qoniqarli his boʻlmoqda.

721
00:39:59,027 --> 00:40:04,227
Keyin buyurtma berishda miqdorini oʻylab olamiz-ku.

722
00:40:04,250 --> 00:40:05,787
Ha, shunday.

723
00:40:05,811 --> 00:40:08,984
Ortiqcha istak xavfli ekan.

724
00:40:09,007 --> 00:40:12,774
Lekin, qoldirmay yeb boʻlgandan xursandman.

725
00:40:12,797 --> 00:40:17,363
Qorni yorilib ketishiga oʻxshaydi, biroz dam olamiz.

726
00:40:17,386 --> 00:40:18,886
18-Sahna: Soʻnggi elektr poyezd / Soʻnggi poyezdga shoshilish

727
00:40:18,886 --> 00:40:21,624
Hozir soat necha?

728
00:40:21,648 --> 00:40:24,881
Soatingiz bormi?

729
00:40:24,904 --> 00:40:30,238
Aniq, hozir 11:15 ekan.

730
00:40:30,261 --> 00:40:34,599
Vay! Allaqachon shuncha vaqt boʻldimi?!

731
00:40:34,622 --> 00:40:39,640
Rostdan, vaqt tez oʻtibdi-ku.

732
00:40:39,664 --> 00:40:43,997
Sizning soʻnggi poyezdingiz soat nechada?

733
00:40:44,020 --> 00:40:48,987
Mening soʻnggisi 11:45 da.

734
00:40:49,010 --> 00:40:53,693
Mening soʻnggi poyezdim 11:30 da ekan!

735
00:40:53,716 --> 00:40:57,089
Atigi 15 daqiqa qoldi!

736
00:40:57,112 --> 00:40:59,746
Bu juda yomon-ku!

737
00:40:59,769 --> 00:41:02,583
Darrov chiqmasak, kechikamiz-ku!

738
00:41:02,606 --> 00:41:06,540
Vokzalgacha piyoda 10 daqiqa ketadi-ku.

739
00:41:06,563 --> 00:41:10,940
Yugursak 5 daqiqada yetib olish mumkin, lekin xavfli.

740
00:41:10,963 --> 00:41:15,196
Hozir darrov doʻkondan chiqmasak, albatta kechikamiz.

741
00:41:15,219 --> 00:41:17,839
Hisob-kitobni tezlashtiramiz.

742
00:41:17,862 --> 00:41:20,359
Ofitsantni chaqiraman.

743
00:41:20,382 --> 00:41:23,751
Xop, hamyonimni olib, tayyorman.

744
00:41:23,775 --> 00:41:27,908
Men hammasini toʻlab qoʻyaman, siz oldin boring.

745
00:41:27,931 --> 00:41:31,774
E, bunday qilib boʻlmaydi-ku!

746
00:41:31,797 --> 00:41:35,174
Keyin LINE orqali pulni yuboring.

747
00:41:35,198 --> 00:41:36,888
Rostdanmi?

748
00:41:36,911 --> 00:41:39,598
Kechirasiz.

749
00:41:39,621 --> 00:41:41,221
Yordam berdingiz!

750
00:41:41,244 --> 00:41:44,778
Qani, palto va sumkangizni oling!

751
00:41:44,801 --> 00:41:47,267
Hech narsani unutmadingizmi?

752
00:41:47,290 --> 00:41:49,324
Soyabonni ham oldim.

753
00:41:49,347 --> 00:41:53,780
Yugurma, tezroq piyoda stansiyaga boring.

754
00:41:53,803 --> 00:41:54,936
Ha!

755
00:41:54,959 --> 00:41:58,736
Bugun juda ham zavqli boʻldi.

756
00:41:58,759 --> 00:42:00,537
Rahmat!

757
00:42:00,561 --> 00:42:03,427
Men ham zavqlandim.

758
00:42:03,450 --> 00:42:06,017
Yetib borgach, xabar bering.

759
00:42:06,040 --> 00:42:08,286
Tushunarli.

760
00:42:08,309 --> 00:42:11,676
Xavfsiz elektr poyezdda oʻtirsam, LINE’dan yozaman.

761
00:42:11,699 --> 00:42:14,432
Ehtiyot boʻling, uyga boring.

762
00:42:14,455 --> 00:42:17,267
Hisob-kitobni iltimos, hal qilib qoʻying!

763
00:42:17,291 --> 00:42:19,691
Juda mazali boʻldi!

764
00:42:19,714 --> 00:42:23,209
Ha! Ishonchingiz komil boʻlsin!

765
00:42:23,232 --> 00:42:25,166
Yugur!

766
00:42:25,189 --> 00:42:26,649
Ha!

767
00:42:26,672 --> 00:42:28,808
Xayr, yaxshi tun!

768
00:42:28,832 --> 00:42:30,876
Xayr, yaxshi tun!

769
00:42:30,899 --> 00:42:32,956
Shoshil!

770
00:42:32,979 --> 00:42:36,513
Ah, ehtiyot boʻling, uyga boring.

771
00:42:36,536 --> 00:42:38,987
Ha, raxmat!

772
00:42:39,010 --> 00:42:42,983
Uff, yetib ketsak yaxshi boʻlardi.

773
00:42:43,007 --> 00:42:44,507
19-Sahna: Ovqatlanib boʻlgach, karaokega / Ovqatdan keyin karaokega boring

774
00:42:44,507 --> 00:42:47,440
Doʻkondan chiqdik-ku.

775
00:42:47,463 --> 00:42:50,430
Shamol juda yoqimli esayapti.

776
00:42:50,453 --> 00:42:52,820
Juda mazali edi, shundaymi?

777
00:42:52,843 --> 00:42:56,293
Qorni toshib ketdi.

778
00:42:56,316 --> 00:42:59,849
Hali oʻn soat ham boʻlmagan-ku.

779
00:42:59,872 --> 00:43:02,125
Tez boʻldingiz-ku!

780
00:43:02,149 --> 00:43:04,749
Rostdan ham shunday.

781
00:43:04,772 --> 00:43:08,138
Keyin nima qilamiz?

782
00:43:08,161 --> 00:43:12,361
Yana bir joyga boramizmi?

783
00:43:12,384 --> 00:43:14,828
Ikkinchi uchrashuv desak boʻladi.

784
00:43:14,851 --> 00:43:17,651
Karaoke qilamizmi?

785
00:43:17,674 --> 00:43:19,968
Karaoke.

786
00:43:19,992 --> 00:43:21,926
Yaxshi ekan!

787
00:43:21,950 --> 00:43:24,517
Qoʻshiq aytishni xohlayman.

788
00:43:24,540 --> 00:43:29,583
Yaqinda qoʻshiq aytmaganim uchun koʻp aytmoqchiman.

789
00:43:29,606 --> 00:43:34,206
Tinch barida dam olish ham yaxshi boʻlardi.

790
00:43:34,229 --> 00:43:38,195
Bar ham katta odamlar muhitida juda yaxshi.

791
00:43:38,218 --> 00:43:40,852
Qaysi kayfiyatdasiz?

792
00:43:40,875 --> 00:43:45,930
Bugun kayfiyatim baland, karaoke yaxshi boʻlardi.

793
00:43:45,954 --> 00:43:48,003
Qaror qabul qilindi.

794
00:43:48,026 --> 00:43:50,886
Karaokega boring.

795
00:43:50,909 --> 00:43:54,343
Yaqin joyda yaxshi karaoke bor.

796
00:43:54,366 --> 00:43:57,499
Stansiyaga yaqin joyda mi?

797
00:43:57,522 --> 00:43:58,655
Ha.

798
00:43:58,678 --> 00:44:01,950
Piyoda uch daqiqalik joyda.

799
00:44:01,974 --> 00:44:04,807
Cheksiz ichimliklar kursini olamizmi?

800
00:44:04,830 --> 00:44:07,397
Hali ichasizmi?

801
00:44:07,420 --> 00:44:10,296
Garchi ulong choyi ham yaxshi.

802
00:44:10,320 --> 00:44:13,653
Bir soat qoʻshiq aytib, ichamiz.

803
00:44:13,676 --> 00:44:15,609
Maqullayman.

804
00:44:15,632 --> 00:44:18,684
Kechgacha qolmaslikka harakat qilaylik.

805
00:44:18,708 --> 00:44:22,280
Ertaga ham ish bor-ku.

806
00:44:22,304 --> 00:44:25,837
Oxirgi elektr poyezdgacha albatta uyga qaytamiz.

807
00:44:25,860 --> 00:44:29,227
Birinchi qoʻshiq nima boʻladi?

808
00:44:29,250 --> 00:44:33,883
90-yillarning esda qolarli pop qo'shiqlarini kuylaymiz.

809
00:44:33,906 --> 00:44:35,673
Juda yaxshi!

810
00:44:35,696 --> 00:44:38,963
Men ham siz bilan birga kuylayman.

811
00:44:38,987 --> 00:44:42,320
Duet qo'shiq ham aytib ko'raylikmi?

812
00:44:42,343 --> 00:44:44,010
Qiziqarli ekan!

813
00:44:44,033 --> 00:44:46,284
Kuchli kayfiyatga kirishamiz!

814
00:44:46,307 --> 00:44:50,473
Endi, karaoke zaliga yo'l olamiz.

815
00:44:50,496 --> 00:44:52,063
Ha.

816
00:44:52,086 --> 00:44:54,219
Yo'lni ko'rsating.

817
00:44:54,242 --> 00:44:56,376
Bu yerga keling.

818
00:44:56,399 --> 00:44:58,332
Menga ergashing.

819
00:44:58,355 --> 00:44:59,855
20-Sahna: To'lovning asoslari / Yapon tilida to'lovning asoslari

820
00:44:59,855 --> 00:45:01,855
Xush kelibsiz!

821
00:45:01,878 --> 00:45:04,170
To'lov qilamizmi?

822
00:45:04,193 --> 00:45:05,593
Ha.

823
00:45:05,616 --> 00:45:08,657
Chek shu yerda.

824
00:45:08,680 --> 00:45:10,151
Iltimos.

825
00:45:10,175 --> 00:45:11,869
Rahmat.

826
00:45:11,893 --> 00:45:15,064
Chekni olaman.

827
00:45:15,087 --> 00:45:18,421
Bugun qancha bo'ldi?

828
00:45:18,444 --> 00:45:22,578
Jami sakkiz ming besh yuz yen bo'ldi.

829
00:45:22,601 --> 00:45:24,368
Tushunarli.

830
00:45:24,391 --> 00:45:27,724
Kredit kartasidan foydalanish mumkinmi?

831
00:45:27,747 --> 00:45:29,314
Ha.

832
00:45:29,337 --> 00:45:33,024
Har xil kredit kartalaridan foydalanishingiz mumkin.

833
00:45:33,048 --> 00:45:35,427
Visa kartasi bilan to'layman.

834
00:45:35,451 --> 00:45:38,084
Tushunarli.

835
00:45:38,107 --> 00:45:40,840
Kartangizni olaman.

836
00:45:40,863 --> 00:45:43,537
Bir martalik to'lov qilaman.

837
00:45:43,560 --> 00:45:45,960
Bir martalik to'lov, shundaymi?

838
00:45:45,983 --> 00:45:49,670
Kartangizni shu yerga tuting.

839
00:45:49,694 --> 00:45:51,591
Pip...

840
00:45:51,614 --> 00:45:53,548
Barchasi tugadimi?

841
00:45:53,571 --> 00:45:55,304
Ha.

842
00:45:55,327 --> 00:45:58,094
To'lov muvaffaqiyatli yakunlandi.

843
00:45:58,117 --> 00:46:02,117
Yaqinda kassalar juda qulay ekan.

844
00:46:02,140 --> 00:46:06,173
Tez va qulay to'lash mumkin, shundaymi?

845
00:46:06,196 --> 00:46:10,163
Chek va kvitansiyani olsam bo'ladimi?

846
00:46:10,186 --> 00:46:11,719
Ha.

847
00:46:11,742 --> 00:46:15,009
Ikkalasi ham beraman.

848
00:46:15,032 --> 00:46:19,087
Kvitansiya nomini „Janob“ deb yozing.

849
00:46:19,110 --> 00:46:21,193
Tushunarli.

850
00:46:21,217 --> 00:46:24,017
„Janob“ deb yozaman.

851
00:46:24,040 --> 00:46:27,840
Alohida to'lash ham mumkinmi edi?

852
00:46:27,863 --> 00:46:29,596
Ha.

853
00:46:29,619 --> 00:46:32,953
Ha, alohida to'lov ham qilishingiz mumkin.

854
00:46:32,976 --> 00:46:36,746
Keyingi safar do'stlarim bilan bo'lib to'laymiz.

855
00:46:36,769 --> 00:46:39,418
Iltimos, yana kelib ko'ring.

856
00:46:39,442 --> 00:46:42,808
Taomlar ham juda mazali edi.

857
00:46:42,831 --> 00:46:45,231
Ovqatlar uchun rahmat.

858
00:46:45,254 --> 00:46:46,821
Rahmat.

859
00:46:46,844 --> 00:46:49,525
Juda xursand bo'ldim.

860
00:46:49,549 --> 00:46:51,582
Yana kelamiz.

861
00:46:51,605 --> 00:46:56,338
Bu sizning chekingiz, kvitansiya va kartangiz.

862
00:46:56,361 --> 00:46:57,828
Ha.

863
00:46:57,851 --> 00:47:00,053
Qabul qildim.

864
00:47:00,077 --> 00:47:03,277
Bugun do'konimizga kelganingiz uchun rahmat.

865
00:47:03,300 --> 00:47:05,598
Yana kelib turing.

866
00:47:05,622 --> 00:47:07,155
Rahmat.

867
00:47:07,178 --> 00:47:09,453
Xayr.